        <ExplanationTxt>THIS COOPERATIVE HAS MEMBERS BUT DOES NOT HAVE VOTING MEMBERS WITHIN THE MEANING OF THE CALIFORNIA NONPROFIT CORPORATION LAW. THE DIRECTORS MAY, IN THEIR DISCRETION, ADMIT INDIVIDUALS OR ORGANIZATIONS TO ONE OR MORE CLASSES OF NON-VOTING MEMBERS WHICH WILL HAVE SUCH RIGHTS AND OBLIGATIONS AS THE DIRECTORS FIND APPROPRIATE. THE DIRECTORS WILL ALSO DETERMINE WHETHER MEMBERSHIP FEES WILL BE ASSESSED.</ExplanationTxt>
