        <ExplanationTxt>THE COOPERATIVE SHALL HAVE UP TO TWELVE VOTING DIRECTORS. SEVEN OF THE TWELVE DIRECTORS SHALL REPRESENT THE CALIFORNIA SCHOOLS VEBA AND SHALL BE APPOINTED BY THE CALIFORNIA SCHOOLS VEBA BOARD OF TRUSTEES. IF THERE ARE NOT 12 MEMBERS, THEN AT LEAST 51% OF THE DIRECTORS OF THE COOPERATIVE SHALL BE APPOINTED BY THE CALIFORNIA SCHOOLS VEBA.</ExplanationTxt>
